{"id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-polynomial.md","title":"Polynomial","display":"df-polynomial — Polynomial","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-polynomial","aliases":["58-df-polynomial","Polynomial"],"display":"df-polynomial — Polynomial","depends_on":["[[58-df-ring]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-polynomial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-polynomial</span><span>Polynomial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial — Polynomial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19475a0b6c0562a5\" href=\"?note=19475a0b6c0562a5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain\">58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"26462d7874ea19c4\" href=\"?note=26462d7874ea19c4\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\">\\(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (finite number of indeterminates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A polynomial is represented by a finite-support coefficient map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N^n\\to R\">\\(a:\\mathbb N^n\\to R\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(a)=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:a(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(a)=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:a(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i&lt;n}\\alpha(i)\">\\(|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i&lt;n}\\alpha(i)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For a set-coded binary operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star:R\\times R\\to R\">\\(\\star:R\\times R\\to R\\)</span>, the notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star(u,v)\">\\(\\star(u,v)\\)</span> abbreviates its graph value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\">\\(\\star(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k)\\)</span> is the finite power determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,0)=1_R\">\\(\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,0)=1_R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k+1)=\\cdot_R(\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k),a)\">\\(\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k+1)=\\cdot_R(\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k),a)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum^{+_R,0_R}\">\\(\\sum^{+_R,0_R}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod^{\\cdot_R,1_R}\">\\(\\prod^{\\cdot_R,1_R}\\)</span> denote the finite folds for the displayed operations, with empty values <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\">\\(0_R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_R\">\\(1_R\\)</span>, respectively</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\)</span> are defined here with the base-ring structure exposed</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb N^n,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb N^n,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\Bigl\\{f\\in R^{\\mathbb N^n}:\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\Bigl\\{f\\in R^{\\mathbb N^n}:\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;(f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R)\n\\land d=\\max\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{i&lt;n}\\alpha(i):\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;(f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R)\n\\land d=\\max\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{i&lt;n}\\alpha(i):\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(y,f,x,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land x\\in R^n\\land y\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land y=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\alpha\\in\\{\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\beta)\\neq0_R\\}}\n\\cdot_R\\!\\left(\nf(\\alpha),\n\\mathop{\\prod\\nolimits^{\\cdot_R,1_R}}_{i&lt;n}\n\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(x(i),\\alpha(i))\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(y,f,x,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land x\\in R^n\\land y\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land y=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\alpha\\in\\{\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\beta)\\neq0_R\\}}\n\\cdot_R\\!\\left(\nf(\\alpha),\n\\mathop{\\prod\\nolimits^{\\cdot_R,1_R}}_{i&lt;n}\n\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(x(i),\\alpha(i))\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}convolution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S(h,f,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(h,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\nh(\\alpha)=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\substack{\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb N^n\\\\\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(\\beta(i)+\\gamma(i)=\\alpha(i))}}\n\\cdot_R(f(\\beta),g(\\gamma))\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}convolution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S(h,f,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(h,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\nh(\\alpha)=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\substack{\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb N^n\\\\\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(\\beta(i)+\\gamma(i)=\\alpha(i))}}\n\\cdot_R(f(\\beta),g(\\gamma))\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}degree\\text{-}convolution}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S(h,f,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_f,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_g,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_h,h,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\to d_h=d_f+d_g.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}degree\\text{-}convolution}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S(h,f,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_f,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_g,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_h,h,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\to d_h=d_f+d_g.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A polynomial is set-coded by its finite-support coefficient map.  This is equivalent to a finite formal sum: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span> is the exponent tuple and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\alpha)\">\\(f(\\alpha)\\)</span> its coefficient.  For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span>, coefficient lookup is therefore <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\langle i\\rangle)\">\\(f(\\langle i\\rangle)\\)</span>, not <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(i)\">\\(f(i)\\)</span>; point evaluation at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> is expressed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(\\_,f,\\langle r\\rangle,\\ldots)\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(\\_,f,\\langle r\\rangle,\\ldots)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The ring structure is part of every public relation.  No one-place polynomial predicate or context-hidden degree operator is introduced: a carrier can admit more than one ring structure, and the degree relation is intentionally undefined on the zero polynomial unless a separate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\\infty\">\\(-\\infty\\)</span> convention is chosen.</li>\n<li>The carrier clause explicitly requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> and a commutative-ring structure.  Consequently invalid structural data do not make the empty set qualify vacuously as a polynomial-ring carrier.</li>\n<li>Point evaluation is separate from coefficient lookup.  Polynomial multiplication is the finite convolution above; for fixed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>, its decomposition set is finite.  Over an integral domain, a monomial order refining total degree gives a nonzero product of leading coefficients, which proves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg(fg)=\\deg(f)+\\deg(g)\">\\(\\deg(fg)=\\deg(f)+\\deg(g)\\)</span> for the nonzero polynomials covered by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The arbitrary-variable carrier in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"26462d7874ea19c4\" href=\"?note=26462d7874ea19c4\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md</a> has the same underlying set when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=n\\in\\omega\">\\(X=n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\omega\\)</span>): every exponent map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> already has finite support.</li>\n<li>Hilbert's basis theorem and Gauss's UFD theorem require separately registered polynomial-ring operations and Noetherian/UFD predicates; they are not asserted here with the base-ring operations incorrectly reused on the polynomial carrier.</li>\n<li>Hilbert's Nullstellensatz gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(V(I))=\\sqrt I\">\\(I(V(I))=\\sqrt I\\)</span> over an algebraically closed field; this is the strong form.</li>\n<li>Resultant: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}(f,g) = 0 \\Longleftrightarrow f,g\">\\(\\mathrm{Res}(f,g) = 0 \\Longleftrightarrow f,g\\)</span> have common root in algebraic closure</li>\n<li>Gröbner bases: algorithmic approach to polynomial ideals; Buchberger's algorithm</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Atiyah and MacDonald, Commutative Algebra</li>\n<li>Cox, Little and O'Shea, Ideals, Varieties, and Algorithms</li>\n<li>Eisenbud, Commutative Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain","status":"resolved","id":"19475a0b6c0562a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"26462d7874ea19c4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"26462d7874ea19c4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The arbitrary-variable carrier in [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md]] has the same underlying set when $X=n\\in\\omega$ (with $\\mathbb N=\\omega$): every exponent map $n\\to\\mathbb N$ already has finite support.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^{7}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^{7}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{8}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathbb N^n\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(a)=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:a(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i<n}\\alpha(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\star:R\\times R\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"\\star(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\star(\\langle u,v\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,0)=1_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k+1)=\\cdot_R(\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(a,k),a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum^{+_R,0_R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod^{\\cdot_R,1_R}","display":false},{"tex":"0_R","display":false},{"tex":"1_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb N^n,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&\\land P=\\Bigl\\{f\\in R^{\\mathbb N^n}:\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land d\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;(f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R)\n\\land d=\\max\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{i<n}\\alpha(i):\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(y,f,x,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land x\\in R^n\\land y\\in R\\\\\n&\\land y=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\alpha\\in\\{\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\beta)\\neq0_R\\}}\n\\cdot_R\\!\\left(\nf(\\alpha),\n\\mathop{\\prod\\nolimits^{\\cdot_R,1_R}}_{i<n}\n\\operatorname{pow}_{\\cdot_R,1_R}(x(i),\\alpha(i))\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}convolution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S(h,f,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(h,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\nh(\\alpha)=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\substack{\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb N^n\\\\\n\\forall i<n\\;(\\beta(i)+\\gamma(i)=\\alpha(i))}}\n\\cdot_R(f(\\beta),g(\\gamma))\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}degree\\text{-}convolution}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialConvolution}_S(h,f,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_f,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_g,g,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d_h,h,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\to d_h=d_f+d_g.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\langle i\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"f(i)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(\\_,f,\\langle r\\rangle,\\ldots)","display":false},{"tex":"-\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg(fg)=\\deg(f)+\\deg(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X=n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"I(V(I))=\\sqrt I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Res}(f,g) = 0 \\Longleftrightarrow f,g","display":false}],"bytes":6674,"backlinks":[{"id":"dd4ed6b174815eef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7$ 与 $\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8$（see [[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]）"},{"id":"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\in V$ (see [[58-df-polynomial]])"},{"id":"e919bc05b2851392","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-polynomial]])"},{"id":"278b9d6853499788","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K[t]$ and $\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}$ (一元有限支撑多项式及系数支撑, see [[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]])"},{"id":"b2f39aba43091cc3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b3f55351a8a5176d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"00787d1ad50fa75c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8$ and $\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^9$ (ring-explicit polynomial relations, see [[58-df-polynomial]])"},{"id":"c36cc156fef49a61","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S$ and $\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S$ are used with their exact ring-explicit signatures from [[58-df-polynomial]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-964","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md|58-df-polynomial]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598","19475a0b6c0562a5","26462d7874ea19c4"]}